<title>USA: Santa Fe Intl unit in Caspian drilling deal.</title>
<headline>Santa Fe Intl unit in Caspian drilling deal.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Fe International Corp said Monday its Caspian Drilling Co Ltd unit has entered into contracts for the operation of semisubmersible drilling rigs owned by the state oil company of the Azerbaijan Republic.</p>
<p>The rigs will operate in the Azerbaijan sector of the Caspian Sea, the company said.</p>
<p>The contracts are not expected to materially affect operating results, the company said. The value of the contracts was not disclosed.</p>
</text>
